      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-19T15:32:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing in a game with Benchmark at the Dok’Thorath capital. Rebel Headquarters and some Freedom Fighters were out and I was enjoying the extra help from the environment. Benchmark had Countermeasrues out.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Freedom Fighters got knocked down to 2 hp. On the environment turn, they let lose with their energy rifles and Benchmark’s Countermeasrues activate and destroy them. I was expecting that Rebel Headquarters would have stopped this from happening.</p>\n<p>Since Benchmark was immune to damage from the Freedom Fighters, shouldn’t Countermeasrues have been nullified? At the least, I should get to choose which effect happens first.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:17.963Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
