      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I was playing in a game with Benchmark at the Dok’Thorath capital. Rebel Headquarters and some Freedom Fighters were out and I was enjoying the extra help from the environment. Benchmark had Countermeasrues out.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Freedom Fighters got knocked down to 2 hp. On the environment turn, they let lose with their energy rifles and Benchmark’s Countermeasrues activate and destroy them. I was expecting that Rebel Headquarters would have stopped this from happening.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since Benchmark was immune to damage from the Freedom Fighters, shouldn’t Countermeasrues have been nullified? At the least, I should get to choose which effect happens first.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
