    {
      "id": 224745,
      "name": "Gus_Smedstad",
      "username": "Gus_Smedstad",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-19T16:16:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The card says “would be dealt damage” not “takes damage.” It triggers when the attack starts, and doesn’t care how much damage would be dealt (including 0). To prevent destroying the freedom fighters, Countermeasures would have to say “when Benchmark is dealt damage by a target with 2 or fewer HP, prevent that damage and destroy that target.”</p>\n<p>I had the same thing happen in that one-shot, incidentally.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:12.442Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
